  "description": "***AVAILABLE FOR 6 MONTHS ONLY***\nSherry FitzGerald Lettings Rathfarnham bring this fine property to the Lettings Market. The Beautiful Marlay Park is literally on the doorstep of this property.   The location of this spacious four bedroomed home could not be better, enjoying a tranquil neighbourhood with the added bonus of being within minutes of the M50, Marlay Park, shopping at Nutgrove, Ballinteer, excellent national and secondary schools, and a mere 10 minutes drive from the Dundrum Shopping Centre and the Luas(Ballally/Dundrum) station. This is a very rare opportunity to rent a property in this mature and quiet residential location. The house benefits from a large garden to the rear and comprises 2 double bedrooms (main ensuite), 2 single bedrooms, family bathroom, fully fitted kitchen, dining room, living room and downstairs wc. The property also has the added bonus of a Garage. This property is being let fully furnished, complete with all modern conveniences. Early viewing is advised.",
